phonon-coreml
Copyright 2026 Fermion Research

Swift package, command-line tool and Python runner for Phonon-2 Core ML (Apache License, Version 2.0).
The model weights live at https://huggingface.co/FermionResearch/Phonon-2-CoreML under CC-BY-4.0; see that repository's NOTICE.
The greedy TDT decoder in Sources/PhononTDT is Fermion Research's C implementation.

UIUI modifications, 2026:
The bounded vocabulary spelling algorithm in BiasPhrases.swift is adapted from
Fermion Research's published hotwords.py under Apache-2.0. The source compact
context decoder, ContextGate.hpp and immutable-history predictor cache were
developed in UIUI's isolated phonon-vocabulary-v3 pilot. Original notices and
license are retained; no model weights or PhononTDT binaries are modified.
